  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "最多八人联机互相连招、掩护，并吹响号角把倒下的队友重新拉回战局。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Bring your homies (or bravely solo it) for chaotic, over the top co-op madness. Combo your attacks, cover each other's backs, and rally your friends by blowing the tooter as the chaos scales from \"this seems fine\" to \"oh no.\"",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2956680/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "剑、法杖、弓与枪械可自由切换，用跨武器组合打出爆炸性连携。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Swords, wands, bows, or the age-old gun— it’s all up to you. Freely swap your weapons, discover explosive combos, and pick your favorite way to slap goblins into next week.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2956680/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "自己选择任务与“配方”，这些选择会决定本局出现的怪敌、诅咒地点和巨型Boss。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Pick your ingredients. Choose your quests. Build the run you want. Choices you make stir the pot, determining which bizarre enemies, cursed locations, and giant, weirdo bosses show up to ruin your day.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2956680/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
